      src/acceptance/defects/pair_mapping.py#1
    [missing_case] run-candidate-tests-against-edit/skipped-pairs-not-asked-after-no-kill
      Pairs held back as not worth asking are only revisited when the first pass produces a kill; if the edit changes candidate tests but none of the asked pairs kill the defect, the skipped pairs are never actually run against the edit.
